    {
      "subId": "7900411",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790050201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790050201": {
            "id": "790050201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon never thought that there'd be a place like this here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790050202"
            ]
          },
          "790050202": {
            "id": "790050202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? There's a journal here, too... Let's see what it says.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790050203"
            ]
          },
          "790050203": {
            "id": "790050203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It says that there will be a gap in the fog around the northern island at noon...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790050204"
            ]
          },
          "790050204": {
            "id": "790050204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well then, why don't we do as the journal says and visit that northern island at noon?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790050205"
            ]
          },
          "790050205": {
            "id": "790050205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Maybe we'll find something new..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7900410",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790042201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790042201": {
            "id": "790042201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This mark... looks like the same spot that was on the journal we found.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790042202"
            ]
          },
          "790042202": {
            "id": "790042202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Maybe that journal and the mural were left by the same group of people!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7900417",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790042701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790042701": {
            "id": "790042701",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still, we can't make complete sense out of the story these murals depict just by looking at them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790042702"
            ]
          },
          "790042702": {
            "id": "790042702",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Maybe there might be similar murals on the surrounding islands nearby...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790042703"
            ]
          },
          "790042703": {
            "id": "790042703",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's look around and see what we can find!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7900419",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790042801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790042801": {
            "id": "790042801",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still, it feels as though these murals are hiding some other message. If only we could get someone to help us decipher it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790042803",
              "790042806"
            ]
          },
          "790042803": {
            "id": "790042803",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! If we do that, and the murals turn out to be clues to some treasure, aren't we just giving it up for free?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790042804"
            ]
          },
          "790042804": {
            "id": "790042804",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That won't do! Let's look for... oh, let's go look for a researcher and get them to help us out!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790042807"
            ]
          },
          "790042807": {
            "id": "790042807",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh, Paimon's heard people say that you can normally find researchers in the library, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790042809"
            ]
          },
          "790042809": {
            "id": "790042809",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's go back there and try our luck, shall we?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790042810"
            ]
          },
          "790042810": {
            "id": "790042810",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Who knows, we might just find the researcher we need there!"
          },
          "790042806": {
            "id": "790042806",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm, that would be best. But where would we find one..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7900422",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790040301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790040301": {
            "id": "790040301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, we've recorded all these murals down. If we connect them, we should be able to put the pieces together."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7900403",
      "subQuestName": "Return to Mondstadt and look for a researcher",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790041201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790041201": {
            "id": "790041201",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "Hello, friend. Is there anything I can do for you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790041202"
            ]
          },
          "790041202": {
            "id": "790041202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Are you a researcher?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790041203"
            ]
          },
          "790041203": {
            "id": "790041203",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "Haha, I suppose I count. Strictly speaking, I am a \"wandering scholar,\" but I suppose that is merely a subset of \"researcher.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790041204"
            ]
          },
          "790041204": {
            "id": "790041204",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "Well, then. Have you encountered a problem that you need a \"researcher\" to help solve?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790041205"
            ]
          },
          "790041205": {
            "id": "790041205",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, here's what happened...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790041206"
            ]
          },
          "790041206": {
            "id": "790041206",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "Islands out at sea... and murals that you found there. How fascinating.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790041207"
            ]
          },
          "790041207": {
            "id": "790041207",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "So you're looking for a researcher who can help you decipher those murals, I gather?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790041209",
              "790041211"
            ]
          },
          "790041209": {
            "id": "790041209",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "Of course, I have never rejected an opportunity to study the unknown.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790041213"
            ]
          },
          "790041213": {
            "id": "790041213",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "Now then, let us not delay. Could I have a look at those murals?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790041214"
            ]
          },
          "790041214": {
            "id": "790041214",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Here are the ones we recorded down.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790041215"
            ]
          },
          "790041215": {
            "id": "790041215",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "Oh, not bad, not bad at all. My apologies, please give me a moment to think..."
          },
          "790041211": {
            "id": "790041211",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "Hahaha. From the look of things, you must be highly-experienced adventurers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790041212"
            ]
          },
          "790041212": {
            "id": "790041212",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "However, I would say that these stories of the unknown are the greatest possible remuneration for me. You need not pay me anything else."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7900404",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Sayid",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790040401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790040401": {
            "id": "790040401",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "Hmm. The contents depicted by these murals are not difficult to decipher in and of themselves. I cannot quite put them all in order yet, but I think there should be no problem if we just tried to understand them one by one.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040402"
            ]
          },
          "790040402": {
            "id": "790040402",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "First, we have this mural, which depicts a group of people who were shipwrecked.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040403"
            ]
          },
          "790040403": {
            "id": "790040403",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "After they were shipwrecked, they must have drifted to the island where you encountered the murals.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040404"
            ]
          },
          "790040404": {
            "id": "790040404",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "They then stayed on that island.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040405"
            ]
          },
          "790040405": {
            "id": "790040405",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "As for this mural, it shows five objects with five different markings within them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040406"
            ]
          },
          "790040406": {
            "id": "790040406",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "Just like five cups filled with water, with each one containing a different amount of it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040407"
            ]
          },
          "790040407": {
            "id": "790040407",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "This sort of artwork usually hints at a change in the state of something.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040408"
            ]
          },
          "790040408": {
            "id": "790040408",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "However, I cannot guess at what this \"something\" is exactly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040409"
            ]
          },
          "790040409": {
            "id": "790040409",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "Still, if this is an island in the middle of the ocean, then this \"something\" could always be \"seawater.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040410"
            ]
          },
          "790040410": {
            "id": "790040410",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "Next, let's look at this mural.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040411"
            ]
          },
          "790040411": {
            "id": "790040411",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "After yet another shipwreck, this island welcomed some new \"guests.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040412"
            ]
          },
          "790040412": {
            "id": "790040412",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "This should be the first batch of people attempting to rescue the second. Also, if you'll have a look at the wreckage depicted here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040413"
            ]
          },
          "790040413": {
            "id": "790040413",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "The first mural only hints at their situation, but this mural goes into quite a lot of detail as to the wrecked ship.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040416"
            ]
          },
          "790040416": {
            "id": "790040416",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "Perhaps this particular shipwreck meant something unusual to the people who wound up on this island.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040417"
            ]
          },
          "790040417": {
            "id": "790040417",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "Then we come to this mural.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040418"
            ]
          },
          "790040418": {
            "id": "790040418",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "Here, I'm sure you can observe that this mountain has been specially marked out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040419"
            ]
          },
          "790040419": {
            "id": "790040419",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "I suspect that this place must have been important to these people.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040422"
            ]
          },
          "790040422": {
            "id": "790040422",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "Finally, we come to this one. Clearly, they found some way to leave this island and thus departed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790040423"
            ]
          },
          "790040423": {
            "id": "790040423",
            "speakerId": 1642,
            "speakerName": "Sayid",
            "text": "The story the murals tell should be as such."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7900420",
